# The floating Advent lantern of St. Wolfgang, in summer: stylised and
# unlit. A Y star finial on a short m/d spike, a pointed m/d roof (lit
# left, never a ledge), a square lattice body: m/d frame with i glass
# panes, a thin m diagonal lattice and h highlights on the lit panes, a
# slack d LED string sagging across the front and coiled at the foot, on a
# square m/d base. Back-layer prop on the pontoon deck: no k, no outline,
# no glow. 80 px tall (the star tip is 80 px above the deck, the eave 62).
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the source.
sprite = adventlaterne
size   = 32x80
origin = 16,80
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
